    "message": "fix: release JNI local references while converting string arrays\n\nRelease each array element's local JNI reference at the end of its iteration.\nKeep CString alive inside the JRef scope so UTF characters are released\nbefore the element reference is deleted. Preserve converted values and order\nwhile bounding reference accumulation within the native call.\n\nRelated: #2170"
